# Governs the `mcp/` build context of `mcp/Dockerfile` (the repository-root `.dockerignore` does not
# apply to it). A superset of that file's entries that can occur here, plus `.npmrc` and nested
# env files, since the runner copies the built tree whole. Do not add an
# `mcp/Dockerfile.dockerignore`: Docker would read it INSTEAD of this one.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
coverage
npm-debug.log
*.log
.env
.env.*
*.md
.git
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
.npmrc
**/.env
**/.env.*
